{"v":[{"a":["وَٱلۡعَٰدِيَٰتِ","ضَبۡحٗا"],"t":"By the racers panting","l":"Wa Al-`Adiyati Đabhaan","w":[["wal-ʿādiyāti","By the racers"],["ḍabḥan","panting"]]},{"a":["فَٱلۡمُورِيَٰتِ","قَدۡحٗا"],"t":"Igniting sparks","l":"Falmuriyati Qadhaan","w":[["fal-mūriyāti","And the producers of sparks"],["qadḥan","striking"]]},{"a":["فَٱلۡمُغِيرَٰتِ","صُبۡحٗا"],"t":"Raiding at dawn","l":"Falmughirati Subhaan","w":[["fal-mughīrāti","And the chargers"],["ṣub'ḥan","(at) dawn"]]},{"a":["فَأَثَرۡنَ","بِهِۦ","نَقۡعٗا"],"t":"Raising clouds of dust","l":"Fa'atharna Bihi Naq`aan","w":[["fa-atharna","Then raise"],["bihi","thereby"],["naqʿan","dust"]]},{"a":["فَوَسَطۡنَ","بِهِۦ","جَمۡعًا"],"t":"Storming into the midst","l":"Fawasatna Bihi Jam`aan","w":[["fawasaṭna","Then penetrate (in the) center"],["bihi","thereby"],["jamʿan","collectively"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","لِرَبِّهِۦ","لَكَنُودٞ"],"t":"Indeed, the human being is ungrateful to his Lord","l":"Inna Al-'Insana Lirabbihi Lakanudun","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["l-insāna","mankind"],["lirabbihi","to his Lord"],["lakanūdun","(is) surely ungrateful"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّهُۥ","عَلَىٰ","ذَٰلِكَ","لَشَهِيدٞ"],"t":"And he bears witness to that","l":"Wa 'Innahu `Ala Dhalika Lashahidun","w":[["wa-innahu","And indeed, he"],["ʿalā","on"],["dhālika","that"],["lashahīdun","surely (is) a witness"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّهُۥ","لِحُبِّ","ٱلۡخَيۡرِ","لَشَدِيدٌ"],"t":"And he is fierce in his love of wealth","l":"Wa 'Innahu Lihubbi Al-Khayri Lashadidun","w":[["wa-innahu","And indeed he"],["liḥubbi","in (the) love"],["l-khayri","(of) wealth"],["lashadīdun","(is) surely intense"]]},{"a":["۞أَفَلَا","يَعۡلَمُ","إِذَا","بُعۡثِرَ","مَا","فِي","ٱلۡقُبُورِ"],"t":"Does he not know? When the contents of the graves are scattered around","l":"Afala Ya`lamu 'Idha Bu`thira Ma Fi Al-Quburi","w":[["afalā","But does not"],["yaʿlamu","he know"],["idhā","when"],["buʿ'thira","will be scattered"],["mā","what"],["fī","(is) in"],["l-qubūri","the graves"]]},{"a":["وَحُصِّلَ","مَا","